# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, git hands Windows CRLF line endings and oxfmt --check reports
# every file in the repo as misformatted — which is exactly what the Windows CI
# leg did before this file existed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets keep their bytes
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
